    MC @ talk "啊……嗯……"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_6_Drunk.rpy:195
translate zh rom_Ves_6_Drunk_abf098b8:

    # "I spent the next while recounting my tale to 维斯, the perilous journey lead by Captain Duprey, the abandoned fort and the strange underground lab..."
    "接下来的时间里，我向维斯讲述了我的故事，包括 杜普雷船长带领的危险旅程、废弃的堡垒和奇怪的地下实验室……"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_6_Drunk.rpy:196
translate zh rom_Ves_6_Drunk_66477c9e:

    # "Finally, I went into detail about the strange creatures that had attached themselves to me and Marcus, and the terms and conditions of our survival for their ‘gift’."
    "最后，我详细描述了那些附着在我和马库斯身上的奇怪生物，以及我们为生存而接受它们‘礼物’的条款和条件。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_6_Drunk.rpy:197
translate zh rom_Ves_6_Drunk_aef1c638:

    # VES @ talk "... I see."
    VES @ talk "...明白了。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/ves/scr_6_Drunk.rpy:198
translate zh rom_Ves_6_Drunk_fec7b863:

